w</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Screenshot 2025-12-22 112524-removebg-preview\">Screenshot 2025-12-22 112524-removebg-preview</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Screenshot_2025-12-22_112524-removebg-preview.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>$460\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hanging_Lamp/\">Hanging Lamp</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Screenshot 2025-12-22 112739-removebg-preview\">Screenshot 2025-12-22 112739-removebg-preview</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Screenshot 2025-12-22 112739-removebg-preview\">Screenshot 2025-12-22 112739-removebg-preview</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Screenshot_2025-12-22_112739-removebg-preview.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>$180\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Exterior_Lamp/\">Exterior Lamp</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Screenshot 2025-12-22 112912-removebg-preview\">Screenshot 2025-12-22 112912-removebg-preview</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Screenshot 2025-12-22 112912-removebg-preview\">Screenshot 2025-12-22 112912-removebg-preview</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Screenshot_2025-12-22_112912-removebg-preview.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>$419\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"secrets\">Secrets</h2>\n<p>There's a small duck taped to the back of The Oak Depot sign, which can be accessed by ladder. \n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Secret Duck New\">Secret Duck New</span></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Secret Duck New 2\">Secret Duck New 2</span></span>\n</p><p>Two <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dark_Wizards/\">Dark Wizards</a> vinyls are located on top of duct pipe.\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Depot secret\">Depot secret</span></span>\n</p><p>Before map revamp above the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Cheese/\">cheese</a> display there were a few rats pulling a heist. \n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: CheeseHeist\">CheeseHeist</span></span>\n</p><p>On the light at the back corner of the store there is a small duck. The player can interact with it to make a quack sound. According to the item, it is owned by a @Nobody\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: LightDuck\">LightDuck</span></span>\n</p><p>By using a ladder at the back exterior wall, you can climb up to the roof. There is a small sign attracted to the main store sign proclaiming \n</p><p>\"Caution: Board is not nailed, it actually uses FLEX SEAL (TM) not sponsored nor endorsed by FLEX SEAL LLC\"\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: BoardISNotNailed\">BoardISNotNailed</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The Current Location\">The Current Location</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The Current Location\">The Current Location</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>The Current Location</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>By walking directly inside and at the counter without the cheese on it, you won't notice anything. Walking into it, however, will lead you into an unnamed secret room with various text on the walls.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: RobloxPlayerBeta bDv3UOZ8Q1\">RobloxPlayerBeta bDv3UOZ8Q1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>"}
